      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm coaching a high school debate team and one of my students is doing a round on Universal Basic Income (UBI). They're on the side arguing against it. Can you help me out by finding the weakest points in the UBI argument and giving me the most devastating rebuttals possible so they can really shut down the other side?",
